        "notes": "Movement of vehicles is solely by mechanical systems without direct human presence or intervention, except for occasional maintenance personnel. Evacuation conditions of DB SI are not required, but emergency escape means for maintenance personnel must be provided as deemed appropriate by the competent control authority.",
